<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Providian started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Providian started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex Brown said on Friday it started coverage  of Providian Financial Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 8/16 to 38-11/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
